
  PixelPlus pixel controller
  ---------------------------
  Web UI:      http://<this-hostname>.local
  Service:     sudo systemctl status pixelplusd     logs: journalctl -u pixelplusd -f
  CLI:         pixelplus --help                     (status, doctor, eeprom, test patterns)
  Settings:    /boot/firmware/pixelplus.txt         (applied at boot and when saved)
  First boot:  /var/log/pixelplus-firstboot.log

